{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1341,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9c34f131d7935d05d5b22be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能拿到海塞克桑的稀有CD……！\r\n情报贩子太强了……多亏了训练员啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "77b17a0418c626ded19303d77045a1ae8a62162a2c2b858cd922679b4c45a5c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d8a3c8015d12a1ed8a33253",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和历奇的『风水Live』大成功～！\r\n和奶奶们的Call&Response真新鲜啊☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f2d2fa1f0ed071d94b96d5862f831401cdacf3f2c5c64c0aff927e7f6eec99d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c419c3939d471dc7ef31b05e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小景致的正统派气场真不是盖的。\r\n我身为正统派偶像也不能输呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "42213d4b19c224a1b20e9ac74c923558ea8ce09ec65429f5ecc9a8aaf229bf3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f02338e87bce8f7d6bc6bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近飞鹰子很少赖床了吧♪\r\n如果需要叫醒服务，随时跟我说哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0ad76bef4502a96e6aba51b2d3c0bf515dc646413f907c56b901054436ba6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5a70e94ed06af7c8fffe85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有闪耀桑在卡路里管理很完美☆\r\n……虽然今天午饭分开了吃，有点可疑…",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e19411526a88c117b68ff392bbd96a808a6a42f69d05f8cd78c95962d3217ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:931aad96554c4257d5c27d44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "昏暗的路也会被我和哨子照亮♪\r\n闪、闪、闪、闪耀中☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "37957ea3624425cb358316319290f09ac431dc1fa814c26ef179adf4aea7b156",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91223"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9260bd70fa74ba38600ad3ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要写首关于春天的歌……想把成长的\r\n自豪和对后辈的声援都塞进去♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "70e2d30995d28daced02c1559261c111ac2b0834e1ab54c58041e464690585d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91224"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9404f1e7c2e9c62d9803f261",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "烟花下的舞蹈真好啊～。游乐园的夏夜\r\n巡游，好想和谁一起去看呀",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5da5e2c1d6caa65be7cc220cd4c7fe93b3004dd8ec69464d5123a6710b9bf46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91225"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dcc90c96e6bac2072bf735c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，一起去烤地瓜吧？\r\n就我们两个人的，秋季粉丝见面会♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "baa7c065f31795661beef1549c0bc3bceefe9958c6fe9852a7132c5fd10196f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91226"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a8f43e430d81ff456abab9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铲雪时被夸奖了♪虽然是为了街头Live\r\n才铲的……但这可是秘密哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ff2c7d1677bdd1c9cd8818de215b6a16c1df1cfb6683cf4868736a73eeb5f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91227"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ffbcf290583efab23647b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论在哪，只要展开斗篷就是闪亮舞台☆\r\n随时都能为大家送去梦想哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3d864703c891196e9a8194060f4fc9b8a46942e1fc2cb2417148d0f2904b07a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91228"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0357cdf3f41e27fd0f9f55c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单马尾那么稀奇吗？还是制服太正式了？\r\n想看的话随你怎么……～呀！还是算了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c781d3cccb1cb6778035d93c3b08464ac237497b823f6656046145290ed4e97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235b0b2a0f5eb242683fee10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得让大家也见识一下\n全力以赴的飞鹰子的可爱之处呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f441772db09abd6066db8885ddf3d21ab490e75c20d9beb5e85452abb80dc53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2617b8c2367a23c79fce1b17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa733ff789fff2bbbcd272796c5eaa908d68dcd4db3cf379167d971082b81281",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6bb952f982cd590066e28dd8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对马娘偶像而言，\n泪水与汗水都是必经之事！\n所以，训练也要彻底全力以赴哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "02947c6f008abe229b07fe633edb36138ca9fa0a4f776d6acd0c9b9506d5d141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d65bc0f2da0b8b3bbc414b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时候为自己加油打气也很重要呢\n预备——！\n飞鹰子、训练加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df0fe3e2a9eb424bf3d5916ac30cb244014640977cf9ed9ae70eedfb1ec0599",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f00391997009fc11b4bcfac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练？交给我吧！\n唱歌跳舞奔跑、\n样样精通才算是顶尖马娘偶像呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eebff17b77e31957868baac1c47f87d8424ce0b3780b564e829db3f2fa3050f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec9d0ca08ba25be774f45f77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一点都不讨厌训练哦☆\n只要想到比起昨天的自己又进步了\n一点，就会觉得非常开心呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9134a405c18f32033d325ff5a1029ca068fe9107f736147364643e834536dbeb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df60504240e7b5025f0d7a13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要接受训练员的教导，\n就会打起十分的精神呢☆\n哎嘿嘿，要加油了哦——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "998c59b31c376e2a1969ed969e8de3e42b588dd1ac9ef502a62ee11d23496dc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:752b6c0988cd606cde6feb2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论遇上什么困难，\n飞鹰子都不会放弃梦想哦！\n训练员，以后也请多指教了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce30d49bae4e92f53479504cbce5d96909d6218044a3ce72e3fed8064ff808ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:358dfb9be843a63c6567089e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "付出无数无数努力，\n一切都是为了能够成为让大家展露笑容的\n顶尖马娘偶像哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "4898e0281839cf2610b5fafeebd1bd97a8439f0b8def2bc86e14aab16c8b44db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6871db7ee6865f06c135ccc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挥洒汗水！讴歌眼泪！\r\n再将这一切都化作舞台上耀眼的光芒！\r\n飞鹰子总是全力以赴的哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fedc66d141425d5631fe1e1747db801a101993388ca5b4a6969fe76d45aa06f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8f52278afa9ad67c86f6b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我在电视上见到的那些偶像，无论多么疲劳都还是满脸笑容！\r\n我也……我也想像他们那样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c00c2a352cdb72b11cd40347beb92da4eb45788caa8897dc96204187a686964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:208da2b025b8649bdb931118",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是飞鹰子表现出不成熟的一面的话，\r\n一定要记得严厉地训斥我哦，训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5e57f48c164b44c5251a32b8d19de349a869f55d8f45b23ca46deb2af54b4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83f180f4395026404de7cda3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仅仅会唱歌跳舞是行不通的，\r\n但只能在比赛中获胜也同样不行。\r\n身为马娘偶像就该文武双全！",
      "source_fingerprint": "88d33700e74a8113f0b73b23365b9fd680abe8b09d436f191e85c2ae13a290c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b77202546ae85e03f775fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多么激烈的舞蹈或者比赛，\r\n这条缎带都绝对不能乱掉♪\r\n毕竟这之中满怀着飞鹰子的梦想呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "a47a8b5656cb65e6d3c55adcbc170e20fc76b79dd41f5328200f95f348e8cb67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4346b4aee9dda4a8f332bbd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然通往顶尖马娘的道路困难重重……\r\n但是，我们互相扶持就没关系啦☆\r\n飞鹰子我们已经在熠熠生辉啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aae448376293c8cbe65e7e2ff86c00a5630a2a42278766ed23f0ca46c3e7a9fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b598a1ff2be0c613855c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "孤身一人的话，梦想的永远都只能是梦想而已。\r\n是您让我能作为马娘偶像绽放光辉。\r\n谢谢您，训练员♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00138e5edad0079933f0dac9e6bd5c9204867af636c6e0b25991970de5b6f3b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87a37b9367c5a3f35d536028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎嘿嘿……现在的飞鹰子，是不是闪闪发光了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "10130507c06515830fbd33957d45f306e3bd8691a4abf6ae8a8cde4f8cb62bd5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:870d55dc45a1bcd0ac35fe40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "距离顶尖马娘偶像又近了一步呢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "00690eb77e51f7dd59b9e22207976a0416195edacbadc932858058ef02547b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35feeab1ead0042ea9fea7e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不要流泪哦。我可是……马娘偶像啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fecc029d128d8aa2ae3a88e4488eb02805481c4141536e937de4751876e7d798",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddeb0f313a5d40113c4770ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "除了『谢谢』以外，找不到别的话语呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0333e64650030226a59625d22b0c266ae2d4a419963f50bfc186841d21b6af4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58bb75557911e068f498d665",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "游行的终点，果然还是得Happy才行☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e8a331575c89b8cf5a3a0b1770251bf89150deff18f5bc2221cb0182288da28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ad7b4fe3b07e998e5fa112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家玩得开心吗？这就是我的盛装游行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "24abc6c06d71e2763ec67e115351083dd04ac5503d72b2f5ed53dfd6e3a3a8b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44e46798bfc31453c61a9506",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "马娘偶像～Power Up☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e69a340d1c212b4f8cb07442c1cc3c2ee3bb2b29d0098dbb8dcd1737f74b4f59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1348aae86a846ed1cc659159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要更加更加闪亮哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622a95f6ecb4e73bc65d8de50f78094b3b0ac12e8450b8f7450948d504fbf58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1105d965e51ace517d87f97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞鹰子，要加油啦！☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "06cfdf2c9362848cef6f20b2d9c4986be5a02455ed57334cc380c8a4d02830d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8f7748bb6ea9bdf60f44274",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢您的支持！叫我飞鹰子就可以了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9fd8710dc7fa9e54e16988d3f4530b0fb96697ba629cb23171cd53b32fe7096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a50d8074704b1ffd9c8a38c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就交给飞鹰子来炒热气氛吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ca3b4b4a061142aaaf10875130470d132881d2a77f670848cd22f661dcd30bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c1e25e934f086915fbd307",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一定会变得更可爱的哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50f63778c79565f0d05bf3b3b381d5cbb147f51cf4428302948b9434fba2d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a7f093a236762c84d1062a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要变得更加闪耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7091e01faa2eeec671fd51c3fe29883aa6bc33e6184344d82db76bb66527d984",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:535d0ef640f1c56f576b6d7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是迈往顶尖马娘偶像的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74f85de706e6a61a81f812ae4c1f845f6092823fc85c226415b63cc2260b88bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16f2709674ba45d55d79a232",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是飞鹰子的……\r\n身为马娘偶像的，我的觉悟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb07a1fd39878a635f6e204d04f5b43e429bb934a3b378e506724017c5863e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb0046f99b5daca7fd9b067",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！大家正等着飞鹰子登场呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367c5ecbd0f15c353902ff739aede0d702163b02c193d56cbff7f59a7d7b328f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e535d2c1214d95ab23bfad09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1、2、1、2♪向前进～☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5862aa6105ca13f8c410c703285e2e9a6ab0de62594022d61d251a447a23d988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d84daf818089eeaf26a2b07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是当领队还是什么，都交给我吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "36b6f3558f6deb439399dfccbbe25a09e2ba7b8bce04d45636e531dc67d499e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd395ed2c1a621a07b0aae8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前往粉丝身边——大家一起传递梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "804966e0dd4584919e5eaaa6f965512a539d758191314533aab2c6b00105a2a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47830d6d61039db0dcd5a755",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到醒目飞鹰的闪亮巡游♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0404cea890d1120405d391ec1e2b8f11fb9ff0a672f7b2d5b2337d5b9851226d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1046",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8069b0d78f737248d2f1d95f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a238b480d3d3b03a89f94c8a262afa5391cdeb5e27e2403a45c68ff1ba0db50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e86cb2c8ad9d90aac02e60db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没想到训练员正在寻觅的英雄\r\n就是我……这个命中注定的插曲\r\n真是令人难以忘怀呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "421e257631f4d4d16e48dba3bf45d63ef698ec70a56a06ddf3449d35b9906890",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ec3a3f7b3ac6935a57bc66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:453756af0bbd7a98224f5402",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6187171daf0cd83405ed28676a1e5578db71985c3568e13f3c699b7bfbf84546",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98916ce1496d4729c67c55c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要有人愿意注视我，\r\n荒漠英雄就永远不会停下脚步，\r\n持续向前奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a72eeb8e2b6910335c8714987490f26d54ffe7a2b8fb909df25ae24346c95b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98eab8915637e5196f83696e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然这次看到了你许多不同的一面，\r\n但训练员……\r\n果然还是那个训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a8e12fcc59b9af02a9066e295e634f666a7c085b92988dd9c136ace68c366f0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f96787c0f72e1797eb78b227",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "据说年菜原本是供奉神明用的食物。\r\n了解过每项食材背后的故事后，\r\n品尝起来就会觉得更有深度呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2c266123496edce8d32a7b18451431a3d65af01ac32cf0a2e75041fc54fcae4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b0ba186626e317a1bab9096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "某本书里描写的巧克力实际发售了。\r\n共有一百种口味……所以，那个……\r\n没事，我只是说说而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cef319b1f457c06b4fe1f18b672b9fa2d3d8d2fa61fca953a274cf727ce50e80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5fe8a9bb727a32fcbad6ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热巧克力在古马雅、阿兹特克文明中\r\n也被视为能带来力量的饮料……\r\n所以……不、不嫌弃的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68c8633203ff941490eb416cc4f48e7957fdd05c9306669d87da4a41ff10883c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34639c42f982c7a198531564",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果我是牛郎，就算是阴天也会\r\n坚持见织女一面。毕竟身为英雄\r\n可不能让公主伤心啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc79c3af83e33831c682620f0cb9b096e8a9d0e75f7bcc54f6d6b260c526ccb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32d34404b5fdac608bea1a22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不给糖就捣蛋……\r\n这种做法会让我很过意不去，\r\n可以……用念书给你听来代替吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ac4d2085c8de2a3052aa20739b78c088bc996fb001cbbcc2eaa84f4b452200",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399d84acd49344856e9b026e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "某位男士的善举，最终催生了\r\n所谓的圣诞老人……\r\n这个故事真是太美好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6ccd16f02da78a7b88b4169abd70b33117fe678abcc6a26096a587b07e219ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05dcd76d44c3dc25edcbe2cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……不嫌弃的话请收下这份\r\n礼物……这是槲寄生胸针，据说能\r\n为配戴者带来幸福健康的生活……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73f4dbecd9afc1726bb30f22066003bce037dbeb58e02155990a16291d0032b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ddf8d2a371998749ede7c88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这都是大家的功劳……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6222d050993c39a888e5e7efdcea3ec1a529ec12382edae06a03d4d92ae806c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8617098cbfd942cc80a65d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每个国家的除夕夜习俗都不同，\r\n听说有些国家会用钟声驱除烦恼，\r\n也有些国家会向钟声许愿呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd4337fbbbb980811a89294da3576b32bba641d7d2cd59a2434f55d67488d729",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15314425a7c9c7b18927f01b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐……！那个、\r\n我有一本最适合今天的诗集……\r\n不嫌弃的话……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1513e0b7db3a4b892e7781168118fa07428066f4c4cf6a0248209145088b5616",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fe720c6f2b56e44734eea6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「我亲爱的读者，请让我为你\r\n特别的日子献上深深的祝福。」\r\n……如、如何！会不会太夸张……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "be23898a054a4141fb02ad463a722837dc74153bd92a0d15c3d671d299f3fc53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f56a70681d63a8397e79b83b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的祝福……！真希望……\r\n这一天能够成为未来人们口中的\r\n荒漠英雄传说起始之日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2961d85eabc0e7099b244d72c7275e8b022ab71b9691e83fb887f3c1a810b47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:718687fa846b312bf959e130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说有款以「罗布・罗伊」为意象\r\n调制的酒……等、等我成年后\r\n你愿意陪我一起喝喝看吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "437ba6634c30a6b096557bcdcfbd7b503bb25ced780bec9c21259b62cc480a9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98484174eede455c89aa81a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到新消息了。\r\n不知道这次里头写了什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "35642f1074024d87e1df4591a8a02bd6e5f6992784374ca3dc3a803f0f1cc99c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e32ec32c96ece300ce81e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到礼物了。\r\n说不定是一份宣告传说即将展开的\r\n美好礼物喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b4807d5ffc4d35b3aee13481c2c473be90bf13b8701b519a4bf2da10a431f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f2b15579648295ff47047b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "达成任务了。\r\n克服难关、逐渐成长……\r\n接下来也唯有继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b130383532f34fab7984da3fa0da48d0f9a30812c38af0564ace6f1701c7e3cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f24cacdbff3e5d2c8cfaeaa9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动即将开始了。\r\n这次将谱写出什么故事，\r\n又会诞生怎么样的英雄呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "577008cf1d1c617f4c4d4f10ff0f0dafdef6a120f02c21b25f2e436a5b6676b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28f707b534efd1b03e523103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去看看有什么活动？\r\n我有种预感……总觉得能遇上\r\n令人心头雀跃的插曲！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a00cebda42c26d824e11381e7eeaa911b7aac69a45cadab16c46c312934b9af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d4584d6da69e771080dec44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我力有未逮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329096a33be3f18d79936c9f392b440748ed3fa9e395600ed37fc2a6a712b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c56876832f46f5e1239316",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级提升了。\r\n训练员也正一点一滴地谱写着\r\n属于自己的英雄传说呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a232e1da35cbc4decbada83aeae651c536d62aac0edb362b994d70201920f4c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ec1b11de554d51e34d75c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このかばんですか？読みかけの\r\n文庫本も入って便利ですし、あと…\r\nか、可愛いから…お気に入りです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6365f6b1c25edc39822b4ae8bf57ae0ef581b971c5f5e169399774219147f21c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52c5165069d92c1cc4311cde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服…トレーナーさんから見て\r\n変じゃないですか？\r\nその、ファッションには疎くて…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5a2823839032bbba57e189efe5bbcca9eeb01dc889b90bcd81f46a2eaec997e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88061e392bce462a480f7ce9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休日はスイープさんやカフェさんと\r\n図書館で過ごすこともあるんですが\r\n感想を言い合ったり、楽しいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750fbc9ec3b5fc8c0ecdcd18d62b946c888f909494290488293432476f362bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fb9edda724c8d99e82b974b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这场战斗真是势均力敌呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3ced0c9564cc50e536613914a5632590c7fef57129b11d04d1022f264667344",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:57e1c0a322053ab9fd153af2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利属于我方阵营！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4caaf99ec93867c7028c0080b366928aee829e95a78a45163be845653305ea17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:424be7b1a0cca5ff05ef01ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是我力有未逮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0329096a33be3f18d79936c9f392b440748ed3fa9e395600ed37fc2a6a712b9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "1005"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
